---
layout: base.njk
title: Home
description: Craig Sturgis is a builder, operator, and founder of Vibecto, helping companies put AI agents to work across the business.
---

<div>
    <section class="grid min-h-[72vh] items-end gap-12 pb-16 pt-8 lg:grid-cols-[1.35fr_0.65fr] lg:pb-24 lg:pt-16">
        <div>
            <p class="eyebrow mb-7">Builder · Operator · Outside execution partner</p>
            <h1 class="display-heading max-w-5xl">I help ambitious teams put agents to work.</h1>
            <p class="mt-8 max-w-2xl text-xl leading-relaxed text-fog sm:text-2xl">
                I’m Craig Sturgis. I’ve spent more than 20 years building products and leading teams. Now I help companies use AI agents to change how the work actually gets done.
            </p>
            <div class="mt-9 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
                <a class="button-primary" href="https://vibecto.ai/how-we-work">See how I work <span class="ml-3" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
                <a class="button-secondary" href="#writing">Read my writing</a>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-sm lg:mx-0 lg:justify-self-end">
            <div class="absolute -left-3 -top-3 h-full w-full border border-mint/50" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            {% image "/img/headshot-2026-neutral.webp", "Craig Sturgis", "(max-width: 1024px) 90vw, 420px", "relative aspect-[4/5] w-full object-cover grayscale" %}
            <p class="relative mt-3 font-mono text-[0.65rem] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-fog">Indianapolis · Working across the Midwest and beyond</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-rule grid gap-8 py-16 lg:grid-cols-[0.65fr_1.35fr] lg:py-24" id="current-focus">
        <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">The current chapter</p>
        </div>
        <div>
            <h2 class="max-w-4xl text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.04em] sm:text-6xl">I founded Vibecto to help companies be more ambitious with agents.</h2>
            <div class="mt-8 grid gap-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-fog sm:grid-cols-2">
                <p>We build agents and AI workflows into sales, operations, client delivery, marketing, finance, support, and software—wherever they can create real leverage.</p>
                <p>The hard part isn’t access to the tools. It’s seeing where they belong, shipping useful systems, and helping the change stick. I stay hands-on with a small number of companies at a time.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-x-8 gap-y-3 font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em]">
                <a class="text-link" href="https://vibecto.ai">Visit Vibecto →</a>
                <a class="text-link" href="https://vibecto.ai/automation-library">Explore the automation library →</a>
                <a class="text-link" href="https://vibecto.ai/contact?source=craigsturgis">Start a conversation →</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-rule py-16 lg:py-24" id="writing">
        <div class="mb-10 flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-end sm:justify-between">
            <div>
                <p class="eyebrow mb-4">Selected writing</p>
                <h2 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em] sm:text-5xl">Notes from the work and the winding path.</h2>
            </div>
            <a href="/posts/" class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-link">All writing →</a>
        </div>
        {% from "macros/post-card.njk" import postCard %}
        {% set featured = collections.posts | filterBy('data.featuredpost', true) %}
        {% if featured.length %}
            <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2">
                {%- for post in featured | reverse -%}
                    <div class="editorial-card">{{ postCard(post) }}</div>
                {%- endfor -%}
            </div>
        {% else %}
            <p class="text-fog">No featured posts yet.</p>
        {% endif %}
        <div class="editorial-card mt-10 flex flex-col gap-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
            <div>
                <p class="eyebrow mb-2">More current thinking</p>
                <p class="max-w-2xl text-lg text-fog">Most of my writing about agents, operating change, and what I’m learning now lives in Vibecto’s insights.</p>
            </div>
            <a class="button-secondary shrink-0" href="https://vibecto.ai/resources">Read Vibecto insights →</a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-rule py-16 lg:py-24" id="experience">
        <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.65fr_1.35fr]">
            <div>
                <p class="eyebrow mb-4">The path here</p>
                <h2 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em]">A winding career in building and leading.</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="divide-y divide-white/15 border-y border-white/15">
                {% set roles = [
                    { company: "Vibecto", role: "Founder", period: "2025 — Present", url: "https://vibecto.ai" },
                    { company: "Prodyssey", role: "Founder & CEO", period: "2024 — 2025", url: "https://prodyssey.com" },
                    { company: "Craig Sturgis Services", role: "Fractional CTO / CPO", period: "2021 — 2024" },
                    { company: "Uncovered", role: "Investor & Advisor", period: "2021 — Present", url: "https://uncovered.com" },
                    { company: "SmarterHQ", role: "VP of Product", period: "2017 — 2021" },
                    { company: "Angie’s List", role: "Director of Product Management", period: "2015 — 2017" },
                    { company: "Haven", role: "Co-founder & CTO", period: "2014 — 2015" },
                    { company: "SmarterRemarketer", role: "Lead Software Engineer", period: "2011 — 2014" },
                    { company: "Aprimo", role: "Software Engineer", period: "2006 — 2011" }
                ] %}
                {% for item in roles %}
                    <div class="grid gap-1 py-5 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_1fr_auto] sm:items-baseline sm:gap-6">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">
                            {% if item.url %}<a class="transition-colors hover:text-mint" href="{{ item.url }}">{{ item.company }}</a>{% else %}{{ item.company }}{% endif %}
                        </h3>
                        <p class="text-fog">{{ item.role }}</p>
                        <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-fog">{{ item.period }}</p>
                    </div>
                {% endfor %}
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-rule py-16 text-center lg:py-24">
        <p class="eyebrow mb-5">Have something ambitious in mind?</p>
        <h2 class="mx-auto max-w-4xl text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.04em] sm:text-6xl">Bring me a real problem. Let’s see what agents make possible.</h2>
        <a class="button-primary mt-9" href="https://vibecto.ai/contact?source=craigsturgis_footer">Talk to Craig <span class="ml-3" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </section>
</div>
